[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02020800_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02020800_03_0010","text":"今天的训练看起来也很充实啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02020800_03_0020","text":"制作人……\n是的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02020800_03_0030","text":"那就好\n合宿虽然要结束了，开心吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02020800_03_0040","text":"非常开心……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02020800_03_0050","text":"有什么收获吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02020800_03_0055","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02020800_03_0060","text":"呵呵……\n是蚂蚁先生……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02020800_03_0070","text":"蚂蚁？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02020800_03_0080","text":"是的……\n给蚂蚁先生们加油了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02020800_03_0090","text":"是朋友之力……呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02020800_03_0100","text":"哈哈，看来和大家打成一片了啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02020800_03_0105","text":"Motion"}]
